    "我听到前门再次被推开，宣告着[regina_ref!t]回来了。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:164
translate zh qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_6aaa7d1e:

    # "After listening out, a few moments later I heard some soft footsteps as the door crept open and [regina_ref!t] peeked inside."
    "侧耳倾听片刻后，我听到轻柔的脚步声，门悄悄推开，[regina_ref!t]探出头来张望。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:173
translate zh qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_e381c644:

    # MC @ talk "... [regina_ref_cap!t]?"
    MC @ talk "...[regina_ref_cap!t]？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:183
translate zh qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_addc3724:

    # "I explained to [regina_ref!t] that I was a part of the Adventurers' guild now. It made her uncomfortable given that I had barely survived my trek with the Scouts..."
    "我向[regina_ref!t]解释我现在已经是冒险者公会的一员了。这让[regina_ref!t]感到不安，毕竟我在侦察队的那次跋涉中能活下来已是万幸……"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:198
translate zh qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_dbff95b5:

    # MC @ talk "[regina_ref_cap!t] blushed as she spoke but waved off the question before I could ask any more."
    MC @ talk "[regina_ref_cap!t]说话时脸红了，没等我追问就摆摆手。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:208
translate zh qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_00478683:

    # "Slowly, [regina_ref!t]'s embrace lessened as she let me head off and finally make my way towards Markus' house."
    "慢慢地，[regina_ref!t]松开了拥抱，让我离开，终于能前往马库斯的家。"

